.resources/TASK-260728-7ii1xz/TASK-260728-7ii1xz_macos-credential-transport-decision.md-252-First, a correction the scope's wording invites: **"the file-based System
.resources/TASK-260728-7ii1xz/TASK-260728-7ii1xz_macos-credential-transport-decision.md-253-keychain with an access group" is a category error.** TN3137: *"The file-based
.resources/TASK-260728-7ii1xz/TASK-260728-7ii1xz_macos-credential-transport-decision.md:254:keychain uses access control lists (`SecAccess`). The data protection keychain
.resources/TASK-260728-7ii1xz/TASK-260728-7ii1xz_macos-credential-transport-decision.md-255-uses keychain access groups."* Access on this path is per-item ACL, not group.
.resources/TASK-260728-7ii1xz/TASK-260728-7ii1xz_macos-credential-transport-decision.md-256-This is the single fact that decides the entitlement verdict in §5.
