.resources/TASK-260728-yx2fca/TASK-260728-yx2fca_results.md-9-- The contract classifies 16 requirements as M0-viability-mandatory and exactly four as M3-deferred, all owned by TASK-260728-3cveay. Host-key-before-auth, approved public-key authentication and algorithms, direct-tcpip, exec/stdin upload, client rekey, bounded buffers, cancellation/lifecycle, Keychain-only secrets, privacy-safe errors, keepalive transmission, and available observability remain binding.
.resources/TASK-260728-yx2fca/TASK-260728-yx2fca_results.md-10-- Each deferred semantic is individually named with pinned libssh2 or ReluxNIOSSH source evidence. Runtime and capability seams use reported, notReported, unsupported, and the validated notApplicable channel-error state where appropriate; the latest receive-window policy preserves its validated initial value and rejects mismatch with the channel policy.
